<title>FRANCE: Sophia  sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond - CPR.</title>
<headline>Sophia  sets 1.0 bln Ffr 10-year bond - CPR.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sophia, a French office property leasing company,  sophia, set a one-billion-franc, 10-year, 5.9 percent domestic bond with a reoffer price of 99.447, lead manager CPR said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The spread is 42 basis points over the interpolated yield of the benchmark 6.50 October 2006 French government bond (OAT) and the 8.50 percent 2008 OAT, CPR said.</p>
